   "id": "weapon-x_term_berserk",
   "name": "Berserk",
   "kind": "keyword",
   "summary": "Flip the top card of your deck into the discard pile and count its printed Attack as a bonus. On an Enemy, the bonus raises what you must beat to fight it.",
